1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
If you put these contacts in,

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,770
you could see flashing lights

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:04,900
with your eyes completely shut.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,250
You see, your eyes normally

5
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:07,610
can’t detect infrared.

6
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:08,890
But these lenses contain

7
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:09,770
tiny particles

8
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,430
that absorb that invisible light

9
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:12,050
and turn it into

10
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,090
colors you can see.

11
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,610
And while your eyelids block

12
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:15,570
much of the visible light

13
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:16,400
around you,

14
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,530
infrared can still pass through.

15
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:19,930
It reaches the lens underneath,

16
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:20,980
gets converted,

17
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:21,810
and becomes a flash

18
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:23,230
you can actually see.

19
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:24,430
So you could look

20
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:25,980
completely asleep…

21
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:26,910
while someone flashes you

22
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:27,750
a secret code

23
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,670
nobody around you can see.

